VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Opus 4.8, GPT 5.5, Gemini, and GLM. So, the app works as a general coding workspace, not just a wrapper for their own model. Right now, in this early'

[04:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'period, it\'s free to use. I don\'t know how long access to the non-Agnes models stays that generous. So, if you want to compare them side by side on your own code, this early window is probably the time. The Agnes models themselves are'

[04:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the ones with the permanent free promise. So, let\'s build something, and I asked for a personal finance dashboard, one page, dark theme, a monthly spending chart, a list of recurring'

