VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'For the technical folks, a few useful details on what\'s live today. The API is OpenAI compatible, so switching means changing the base URL, the key, and the model name, and your existing code'

[08:52] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'mostly just works. There\'s an Anthropic compatible option, too. The 2.0 flash model has a 256K context window with up to 64K output tokens, an optional'

[09:04] [scene:talk]
